<section class="sec sec-stone"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head left rv"><p class="kicker dark">Regions</p><h2>How claims differ across Wyoming</h2><p>The same policy wording plays out very differently on a Cheyenne ranch house, a Gillette metal shop and a Teton County timber home.</p></div><div class="igrid" data-stagger><div class="icard rv"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/cheyenne-depot.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/cheyenne-depot-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/cheyenne-depot.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k">Cheyenne · Laramie · Wheatland · Torrington</span><h3>Southeast plains</h3><p>Hail, downslope wind and flash flooding along the Front Range and the North Platte valley.</p></span></div><div class="icard rv"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/casper-downtown.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/casper-downtown-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/casper-downtown.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k">Casper · Riverton · Lander · Douglas</span><h3>Central basins</h3><p>Winter windstorms, cold inversions and summer hail in the North Platte and Wind River basins.</p></span></div><div class="icard rv"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/gillette-avenue.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/gillette-avenue-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/gillette-avenue.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k">Gillette · Sheridan · Buffalo · Newcastle</span><h3>Powder River &amp; Bighorns</h3><p>Severe summer thunderstorms, large hail and occasional tornadoes on the northeast plains.</p></span></div><div class="icard rv"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/green-river-island.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/green-river-island-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/green-river-island.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k">Rock Springs · Green River · Evanston · Rawlins</span><h3>Southwest &amp; I-80</h3><p>Relentless wind, ground blizzards and frozen pipes along the I-80 corridor.</p></span></div><div class="icard rv"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/jackson-downtown.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/jackson-downtown-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/jackson-downtown.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k">Jackson · Cody · Pinedale · Afton</span><h3>Northwest mountains</h3><p>Heavy snow loads, ice dams, wildfire and high-value custom homes.</p></span></div></div></div></section>
